---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Ramia Studio" lang="en">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 md:py-24 min-h-[70vh]">
    <article class="prose prose-neutral prose-sm sm:prose-base mx-auto font-body text-neutral-700 font-light leading-relaxed space-y-6 prose-headings:font-display prose-headings:font-normal prose-headings:tracking-wide">
      
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl text-neutral-900 mb-8 font-normal tracking-wide">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>In accordance with the GDPR, we inform you about how we handle your data.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-neutral-900 mt-10 mb-4 font-normal tracking-wide">1. Purpose of Processing</h2>
      <p>Data collected via WhatsApp or email will be used exclusively to manage orders, answer queries, and provide personalized customer service.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-neutral-900 mt-10 mb-4 font-normal tracking-wide">2. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You can exercise your rights of Access, Rectification, Cancellation, or Opposition by emailing <a href="mailto:hola@ramiastudio.com" class="underline hover:text-neutral-900">hola@ramiastudio.com</a>.</p>
  
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>